{"n":101,"name":"Al-Qari'ah","meaning":"The Striking Hour","ayahs":11,"startPage":600,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","tr":"AlqariAAatu","en":"The Striking Calamity"},{"i":2,"ar":"مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","tr":"Ma alqariAAatu","en":"What is the Striking Calamity"},{"i":3,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","tr":"Wama adraka ma alqariAAatu","en":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity"},{"i":4,"ar":"يَوۡمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ","tr":"Yawma yakoonu alnnasu kaalfarashi almabthoothi","en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed"},{"i":5,"ar":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلۡجِبَالُ كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ","tr":"Watakoonu aljibalu kaalAAihni almanfooshi","en":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up"},{"i":6,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","tr":"Faamma man thaqulat mawazeenuhu","en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds]"},{"i":7,"ar":"فَهُوَ فِي عِيشَةٖ رَّاضِيَةٖ","tr":"Fahuwa fee AAeeshatin radiyatin","en":"He will be in a pleasant life"},{"i":8,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ خَفَّتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","tr":"Waamma man khaffat mawazeenuhu","en":"But as for one whose scales are light"},{"i":9,"ar":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٞ","tr":"Faommuhu hawiyatun","en":"His refuge will be an abyss"},{"i":10,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهۡ","tr":"Wama adraka ma hiyah","en":"And what can make you know what that is"},{"i":11,"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةُۢ","tr":"Narun hamiyatun","en":"It is a Fire, intensely hot"}]}